# 1 (Sol Ring, Black Lotus, Mox Jet). On turn 2 Bot2 casts Preordain and scries 2: Bot1's Planetarium does not trigger,
# so nothing goes on the stack after the scry and Bot1 looks at nothing (`Bot1.Looked` absent). The other Planetarium
# scenarios, in which Bot1 scries or surveils, are the positive control.

